Modifications
-------------
The files src/decoder.js, src/lm.js, src/syllables.js and src/audio.js in this
repository are JavaScript ports of sar_decoder.py, sar_syllables.py and
transcribe.py from the Nara SAR release. They were translated from Python to
JavaScript so the decoder can run in a web browser, and they keep the original
decoding recipe unchanged (beam 16, top-k 10, alpha 0.6, beta 0, blank id 0,
bilingual character 6-gram language model, Burmese structural syllable rules).
The Python originals are kept unmodified in tools/reference/ for parity testing.

No model weights are redistributed in this repository. The client downloads
them at runtime either from its own ./models directory or from the Hugging Face
repository above, and caches them in the browser's origin private file system.

